  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund for Education Partnerships CYED Contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project was set up to hold the GED budget prior to bringing on board the strategic partners. Strategic partners are a select group of actors who will work and partner with governments to improve effective implementation, evidence-based reforms at scale, focusing on increasing literacy, numeracy, and foundational skills. It directly impacts up to 3 million children and influences up to 17 million more, prioritising the most marginalised.</narrative>
  </description>
